d":5,"rd_mitigation":"Fortnightly GTA invoices are raised on 1st working day from the end of FN and are collected within 4 working days;\nIncase of delay in collection CCM team / Budget Planning and Billing team levies Interest as per agreement terms","rd_current_risk_likelihood_id":2,"rd_current_risk_impact_id":3,"rd_created_by":282,"rd_created_on":"2026-07-08T10:25:43.608076","rd_modified_by":null,"rd_modified_on":null,"rd_is_deleted":0,"inherent_color_str":"#FF0000","inherent_color_code":"4E","current_color_str":"#90EE90","current_color_code":"2C","risk_owner_name":"ramesh@example.com","risk_status_name":"Open","function_head_approval_status_name":" ","risk_manager_approval_status_name":" ","risk_head_approval_status_name":" ","action_required":false},{"risk_register_id":4863,"risk_id":"FIN-0206","risk_name":"Credit Management","dept_id":6,"risk_owner_id":283,"financial_year":"2026-2027","risk_status":9,"risk_progress":"0","risk_function_head_approval_status":null,"risk_function_head_approval_remark":null,"risk_function_head_approval_on":null,"risk_function_head_approval_by":null,"risk_head_approval_status":null,"risk_head_approved_on":null,"risk_head_approval_remark":null,"risk_head_approval_by":null,"risk_manager_approval_status":null,"risk_manager_approved_on":null,"risk_manager_approval_remark":null,"risk_manager_approval_by":null,"created_by":283,"created_on":"2026-07-08T10:25:43.158896","modified_by":null,"modified_on":null,"is_active":0,"is_deleted":0,"risk_co_owner_id":283,"rd_risk_description_id":4522,"rd_risk_register_id":4863,"rd_risk_id":"FIN-0206","rd_risk_description":"Inadequate financial security due to weak credit control process (RC) diffculty in recovery (RE) resulting in default (C )","rd_inherent_risk_likelihood_id":5,"rd_inherent_risk_impact_id":3,"rd_mitigation":"Ensures payment security for all customers (except RIL and GSPL- Gujarat State Petronet Limited) before initiating gas transportation or enhancing Maximum Delivery Quantity (MDQ), either through (a) Letter of Credit or (b) Security Deposit or (c) advance payment.\nOn Quarterly basis, Lead CCM monitors customer credit and ensures gas transportation is not allowed in case customer outstanding is more than 80% of the maximum-security available at all times.\n\nOnline Credit monitoring portal developed for monitoring of credit line on real time basis","rd_current_risk_likelihood_id":4,"rd_current_risk_impact_id":5,"rd_created_by":283,"rd_created_on":"2026-07-08T10:25:43.620401","rd_modified_by":null,"rd_modified_on":null,"rd_is_deleted":0,"inherent_color_str":"#FFA500","inherent_color_code":"5C","current_color_str":"#FF0000","current_color_code":"4E","risk_owner_name":"priya@example.com","risk_status_name":"Open","function_head_approval_status_name":" ","risk_manager_approval_status_name":" ","risk_head_approval_status_name":" ","action_required":false},{"risk_register_id":4864,"risk_id":"FIN-0207","risk_name":"Vendor Payment Management","dept_id":6,"risk_owner_id":284,"financial_year":"2026-2027","risk_status":9,"risk_progress":"0","risk_function_head_approval_status":null,"risk_function_head_approval_remark":null,"risk_function_head_approval_on":null,"risk_function_head_approval_by":null,"risk_head_approval_status":null,"risk_head_approved_on":null,"risk_head_approval_remark":null,"risk_head_approval_by":null,"risk_manager_approval_status":null,"risk_manager_approved_on":null,"risk_manager_approval_remark":null,"risk_manager_approval_by":null,"created_by":284,"created_on":"2026-07-08T10:25:43.185377","modified_by":null,"modified_on":null,"is_active":0,"is_deleted":0,"risk_co_owner_id":284,"rd_risk_description_id":4523,"rd_risk_register_id":4864,"rd_risk_id":"FIN-0207","rd_risk_description":"Payments recorded are invalid, inaccurate (RC), and posted in inappropriate period/ wrong vendor (RE) resulting incorrect financials/ vendor balances/ fradulent payment (C).","rd_inherent_risk_likelihood_id":2,"rd_inherent_risk_impact_id":2,"rd_mitigation":"Treasury team executes payment proposal, created by AP team, in SAP which automatically raises payment requests on the bank portal (host to host) and the authorized signatory approves payment request on bank portal using authorized bank ids & SAP is configured to auto-record the payment journal entry.\nIn exceptional cases, manual payments are processed after approval by the authorized signatories;Monthly BRS is done to ensure booking are done in appropriate period","rd_current_risk_likelihood_id":3,"rd_current_risk_impact_id":3,"rd_created_by":284,"rd_created_on":"2026-07-08T10:25:43.636620","rd_modified_by":null,"rd_modified_on":null,"rd_is_deleted":0,"inherent_color_str":"#008000","inherent_color_code":"2B","current_color_str":"#FFFF00","current_color_code":"3C","risk_owner_name":"raj@example.com","risk_status_name":"Open","function_head_approval_status_name":" ","risk_manager_approval_status_name":" ","risk_head_approval_status_name":" ","action_required":false},{"risk_register_id":4865,"risk_id":"FIN-0208","risk_name":"User Access management of system","dept_id":6,"risk_owner_id":283,"financial_year":"2026-2027","risk_status":9,"risk_progress":"0","risk_function_head_approval_status":null,"risk_function_head_approval_remark":null,"risk_function_head_approval_on":null,"risk_function_head_approval_by":null,"risk_head_approval_status":null,"risk_head_approved_on":null,"risk_head_approval_remark":null,"risk_head_approval_by":null,"risk_manager_approval_status":null,"risk_manager_approved_on":null,"risk_manager_approval_remark":null,"risk_manager_approval_by":null,"created_by":283,"created_on":"2026-07-08T10:25:43.206039","modified_by":null,"modified_on":null,"is_active":0,"is_deleted":0,"risk_co_owner_id":283,"rd_risk_description_id":4524,"rd_risk_register_id":4865,"rd_risk_id":"FIN-0208","rd_risk_description":"Unauthorized and inappropriate user access (RC) may results in fraudulent (RE) and incorrect accounting (C ).","rd_inherent_risk_likelihood_id":2,"rd_inherent_risk_impact_id":2,"rd_mitigation":"SAP IT Team will provide the access control matrix of Finance module to Respective Functional Heads, Employees' access to SAP are reviewed on annual basis by the Respective Functional Heads and validated by CFO to ensure that there are proper access restriction and segregation of duties.\n\nAccess to the various System SAP modules is appropriately restricted, and Inactive or unauthorized users and roles are removed promptly by SAP IT Team based on notification by e-mail/termination information received from HR team.","rd_current_risk_likelihood_id":3,"rd_current_risk_impact_id":3,"rd_created_by":283,"rd_created_on":"2026-07-08T10:25:43.651819","rd_modified_by":null,"rd_modified_on":null,"rd_is_deleted":0,"inherent_color_str":"#008000","inherent_color_code":"2B","current_color_str":"#FFFF00","current_color_code":"3C","risk_owner_name":"priya@example.com","risk_status_name":"Open","function_head_approval_status_name":" ","risk_manager_approval_status_name":" ","risk_head_approval_status_name":" ","action_required":false},{"risk_register_id":4866,"risk_id":"FIN-0209","risk_name":"Inventory management","dept_id":6,"risk_owner_id":284,"financial_year":"2026-2027","risk_status":9,"risk_progress":"0","risk_function_head_approval_status":null,"risk_function_head_approval_remark":null,"risk_function_head_approval_on":null,"risk_function_head_approval_by":null,"risk_head_approval_status":null,"risk_head_approved_on":null,"risk_head_approval_remark":null,"risk_head_approval_by":null,"risk_manager_approval_status":null,"risk_manager_approved_on":null,"risk_manager_approval_remark":null,"risk_manager_approval_by":null,"created_by":284,"created_on":"2026-07-08T10:25:43.228576","modified_by":null,"modified_on":null,"is_active":0,"is_deleted":0,"risk_co_owner_id":284,"rd_risk_description_id":4525,"rd_risk_register_id":4866,"rd_risk_id":"FIN-0209","rd_risk_description":"Inventory appearing in the SAP do not exist physically (RC) resulting in misstatement of closing stock (RE) & incorrect financials (C ).","rd_inherent_risk_likelihood_id":2,"rd_inherent_risk_impact_id":5,"rd_mitigation":"Physical verification for inventory is carried out by authorized personnel from the Stores Department as well as a third party.\n\n-Discrepancies in physical verification without financial impact are reviewed & approved by Site Discipline Lead, Area Manager, Head of department of Concerned function and  Head of Department materials, and VP - Accounts & Audit;\n-Discrepancies having a financial impact are reviewed and approved by the CFO and MD.Internal Auditor (external) will also check inventory once in three years on test check basis.","rd_current_risk_likelihood_id":1,"rd_current_risk_impact_id":1,"rd_created_by":284,"rd_created_on":"2026-07-08T10:25:43.663222","rd_modified_by":null,"rd_modified_on":null,"rd_is_deleted":0,"inherent_color_str":"#FFA500","inherent_color_code":"2E","current_color_str":"#008000","current_color_code":"1A","risk_owner_name":"raj@example.com","risk_status_name":"Open","function_head_approval_status_name":" ","risk_manager_approval_status_name":" ","risk_head_approval_status_name":" ","action_required":false},{"risk_register_id":4867,"risk_id":"FIN-0210","risk_name":"investment/redemption in Mutual funds","dept_id":6,"risk_owner_id":281,"financial_year":"2026-2027","risk_status":9,"risk_progress":"0","risk_function_head_approval_status":null,"risk_function_head_approval_remark":null,"risk_function_head_approval_on":null,"risk_function_head_approval_by":null,"risk_head_approval_status":null,"risk_head_approved_on":null,"risk_head_approval_remark":null,"risk_head_approval_by":null,"risk_manager_approval_status":null,"risk_manager_approved_on":null,"risk_manager_approval_remark":null,"risk_manager_approval_by":null,"created_by":281,"created_on":"2026-07-08T10:25:43.262329","modified_by":null,"modified_on":null,"is_active":0,"is_deleted":0,"risk_co_owner_id":281,"rd_risk_description_id":4526,"rd_ris